---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';

const description = 'Practice coding, system design, behavioral questions, and other interview formats across 51 companies.';
---

<Base title="Interview Notebook" description={description}>
  <article class="container page-shell">
    <a class="text-link" href="/projects/">← All projects</a>
    <h1 class="page-title">Interview Notebook.</h1>
    <p class="page-intro">{description}</p>
    <a class="button primary" href="https://interview.jacobroutzong.dev/">Open Interview Notebook →</a>
    <p>Progress is saved in your browser at each address. <a class="text-link" href="/projects/interview-notebook/lab/">Open the portfolio-hosted notebook</a> to resume progress saved on this site.</p>

    <section class="section" aria-labelledby="code-workspace">
      <h2 id="code-workspace">Run a solution</h2>
      <p>Run solutions for 29 tracker exercises across 26 companies. Twenty-three accept Python or JavaScript, and six use SQLite. Try a custom input, then submit your answer to see how it performs on the test cases. Drafts and results stay in this browser.</p>
      <a class="text-link" href="https://interview.jacobroutzong.dev/#workspace">Open the code workspace →</a>
    </section>

    <section class="section" aria-labelledby="practice-bank">
      <h2 id="practice-bank">The practice bank</h2>
      <p>Choose a company and interview category, or save a shortlist of companies in this browser. The tracker includes 640 exercises with follow-up questions and scoring guides. Every company has at least three original exercises in each of the four categories. Across the notebook, 22 exercises draw on examples published by employers.</p>
      <p>Each company also has six to eight external coding problems. Open the title to practice or follow the source to see why it was included. Find titles lets you search the broader liquidslr directory. PracHub also covers system design, behavioral, and specialty practice. Use Practice to search titles and switch between variants. Export a coverage snapshot or a Codex alert from the tracker. Titles you add are stored in this browser.</p>
      <p>The original Airbnb preparation page cited by two exercises is currently unavailable.</p>
    </section>
  </article>
</Base>
